     "body": "<p>What is needed beyond what is here: <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Messaging#Messaging-DistributedBrokers\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Messaging#Messaging-DistributedBrokers</a> ?</p>",
